31.700 = 30 + 1.700   mxrstpdb status 子樹         ADR-0016 / agentx_owned.list
31.000 = 30 + 1.000   mainline .603.3.2            ADR-0016
30.994 = 30 + 0.994   mxrstpdb(ADR-0018 引用)    ADR-0018
30.953 = 30 + 0.953   簡報頭條 mainline            
